  "issue": {
    "body": "`starlette.datastructures.ImmutableMultiDict.getlist()` could return a list of List[UploadFile] in some circumstances.\r\n\r\n### Code to reproduce\r\n```python\r\n@router.post(\"/upload\")\r\nasync def create_training_set(request: Request) -> Any:\r\n\r\n    form = await request.form()\r\n    files = form.getlist('file')\r\n\r\n    print(type(files))\r\n    print(type(files[0]))\r\n\r\n    print(type(form.getlist('label')))\r\n    print(type(form.getlist('label')[0]))\r\n```\r\noutput:\r\n```\r\n<class 'list'>\r\n<class 'starlette.datastructures.UploadFile'>\r\n<class 'list'>\r\n<class 'str'>\r\n```\r\nThe request was made from a flutter (mobile) lib, if needed, I can provide more details about the request.\r\n\r\nThis is compliant with the [doc](https://www.starlette.io/requests/#request-files), it's just a Typing issue I would say",
    "closed_at": "2021-09-25T22:50:04Z",
    "created_at": "2020-07-07T07:33:29Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/issues/994",
